# audio_sim.jgs -- audiorecorder's recordings and what audioplayer, sound and soundsc play, on
# jgraph.internal.audiosim's devices (device classes plan, stage D10, ADR 0193). JGraph-only: R2025b is
# not asked to record from this machine's microphone, and its outputs keep nothing to read back, so
# expected/audio_sim.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/audio_sim_case.m.

